Solution: TravelStack

TravelStack is a centralized microservices-based travel package booking system designed to streamline the travel booking process by enabling users to explore packages, check availability, make bookings, and complete payments through an integrated platform.

The platform provides a structured environment where:

Users can register, log in, and securely access the platform

Users can explore available travel packages and check prices and availability

Users can select packages and make travel bookings

Payment Service handles booking payments and maintains transaction status

Package Service manages travel packages and updates availability

Booking Service manages reservations and booking status

API Gateway and Eureka Server enable secure routing, service discovery, and communication between microservices

All interactions are managed through secure JWT authentication and independent microservices.

Key Features

